    "created_at": "2016-09-14T14:29:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-14T14:29:39Z",
    "body": "With the BLE APIs in general (but at least on macOS), when scanning for devices, we scan for advertisement. For having the connected devices, we have different API. I'm guessing it would be still interesting to still be able to make the difference between both result. That's why I think it would be interesting to filter for one or the other according to what we want to do.\nAnd the best example would be to make sure the user will choose the right device to upgrade the firmware.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
