    "created_at": "2016-09-15T21:52:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-15T21:52:37Z",
    "body": "Seems like a reasonable filter. Is there a reason to put it directly on the `RequestDeviceOptions` instead of in a `BluetoothRequestDeviceFilter`?\n\nCan we implement this on all platforms? I think so, but I'll need to double-check before adding it to the spec.\n",
