    "created_at": "2016-09-16T00:01:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-16T00:01:52Z",
    "body": "Regarding the implementation, macOS has retrieveConnectedPeripheralsWithServices and Android has BluetoothManager.getConnectedDevices() and on windows we basically do this whenever someone calls StartDiscovery. So it's possible to implement on all platforms.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
